      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p><strong>General information, not legal advice.</strong> Content published by Property and Rent Consult (PRC) — on this website, in its products, and in its communications — is general information about property and tenancy practice in Ghana. It is not legal advice, and reading it creates no solicitor–client or advisor–client relationship. For advice on a specific situation, engage a qualified professional.</p>
      <p><strong>Separation from Rent Control proceedings.</strong> PRC provides general guidance and documentation; it does not represent parties in Rent Control proceedings adjudicated by its principals, and engagement of PRC confers no advantage in any matter before any Rent Control office.</p>
      <p><strong>Statutory references.</strong> References to the Rent Act, 1963 (Act 220) and the Rent Regulations, 1964 (L.I. 369) are made in good faith and reviewed periodically; the statutes themselves are always the authority.</p>
      <p><strong>Currency of information.</strong> Each Knowledge Hub article carries a "last reviewed" date. Where law or practice changes after that date, the change prevails over our text.</p>
